cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fep_formal: Towards Lean 4 Formalization of the Free Energy Principle"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked catalogue of 155 Free Energy Principle topics spanning
  FEP foundations, Active Inference, Bayesian Mechanics, Information Geometry,
  and non-equilibrium Thermodynamics, each represented by a namespaced Lean 4
  sketch against Mathlib 4. The accompanying Python pipeline layers configured
  Hermes commentary and OpenGauss persistence atop the Lean 4 kernel as sole
  ground truth. Native Lean verification is accepted only after the pinned
  Lean 4.34.0 / Mathlib 4.34.0 workspace compiles every row without proof
  holes.
